Good morning job seekers!  Take a look at this one:
&gt; Nick Fram leads the Safety team at Reflection (Member of Technical Staff, Head of Safety) overseeing end-to-end safety research, pre/mid/postraining Safety, safeguards, national security testing, Safety evals, frontier risk evaluations across all harm domains, defensive acceleration, threat modeling, T&amp;S, among other areas. Includes all alignment related Safety.
&gt; 
&gt; He previously led research teams developing and deploying CBRNE and Cyber safeguards, as well as model capability evaluations, at Anthropic (Member of Technical Staff) and Google DeepMind (Research Scientist) following years of both operational and technical work across counter-terrorism, biodefense, cyber, and machine learning for the US government.
&gt; 
